{"id":"e0da4f753f223026","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-discrepancy.md","title":"Rectangle Discrepancy","display":"df-discrepancy — Rectangle Discrepancy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-discrepancy","aliases":["28-df-discrepancy"],"display":"df-discrepancy — Rectangle Discrepancy","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.2.4","source_printed_pages":"275","source_pdf_pages":"301","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-discrepancy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-discrepancy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-discrepancy — Rectangle Discrepancy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.2.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"275"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"301"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:X\\times Y\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\mu:X\\times Y\\to[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{x,y}\\mu(x,y)=1\">\\(\\sum_{x,y}\\mu(x,y)=1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_U(x,y)=1/(|X||Y|)\">\\(\\mu_U(x,y)=1/(|X||Y|)\\)</span> 为均匀概率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{disc}_{\\mu}(f;A,B)\\coloneqq\\left|\\sum_{x\\in A,y\\in B}\\mu(x,y)(-1)^{f(x,y)}\\right|\\quad(A\\subseteq X,B\\subseteq Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{disc}_{\\mu}(f;A,B)\\coloneqq\\left|\\sum_{x\\in A,y\\in B}\\mu(x,y)(-1)^{f(x,y)}\\right|\\quad(A\\subseteq X,B\\subseteq Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disc}_{\\mu}(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{A\\subseteq X,B\\subseteq Y}\\operatorname{disc}_{\\mu}(f;A,B),\\qquad\\operatorname{Disc}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Disc}_{\\mu_U}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Disc}_{\\mu}(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{A\\subseteq X,B\\subseteq Y}\\operatorname{disc}_{\\mu}(f;A,B),\\qquad\\operatorname{Disc}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Disc}_{\\mu_U}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>教材采用均匀概率；这里将权重参数显式绑定并以均匀特例对应原书。有限矩形族保证最大值达到。某个正质量单元素矩形给严格正差异度，因此后续取倒数合法。</p>\n<p>来源：§13.2.4；印刷页 275；PDF 页 301。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第13章的 Rectangle Discrepancy，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:X\\times Y\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{x,y}\\mu(x,y)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_U(x,y)=1/(|X||Y|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{disc}_{\\mu}(f;A,B)\\coloneqq\\left|\\sum_{x\\in A,y\\in B}\\mu(x,y)(-1)^{f(x,y)}\\right|\\quad(A\\subseteq X,B\\subseteq Y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Disc}_{\\mu}(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{A\\subseteq X,B\\subseteq Y}\\operatorname{disc}_{\\mu}(f;A,B),\\qquad\\operatorname{Disc}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Disc}_{\\mu_U}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1588,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-matrix]]、[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]、[[28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound]]、[[28-df-discrepancy]]、[[28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound]]、[[28-df-number-on-forehead]]。"},{"id":"b74fca4eda5da9e2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu$ 见 [[28-df-discrepancy]]；$\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]] 给协议分割界。"}],"outgoing":[]}